# The working tree's line ending is pinned so that it is a fact rather than a
# function of each clone's `core.autocrlf`. A derived script is required to emit
# the checkout's ending, and until something pinned one there was no such value
# to emit. ADR 0069 has the reasoning and what was rejected.
#
# `text=auto` rather than `text`: git decides per file whether it is text, so
# nothing binary is converted. The `eol` attribute has effect only where that
# detection says text.
* text=auto eol=lf
